{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"X\",\n    \"small\": \"Y\",\n    \"core\": \"X\",\n    \"concise\": \"X\",\n    \"human\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\",\n    \"load\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big、core：X 的高亮词从想靠近、怕成为负担、被对方接纳，一直串到不再隐藏喜欢、接受无法保证永远，关系变化和亲密幸福与留不住它的痛楚都比较清楚；Y 有多屏没有大字话块，主线大量依赖小字，而且开头把仍在试探的关系说成已经身处真实的亲密相处，削弱了故事的起点。small、fine：Y 把音乐声部描写放进旁注，感受则更多落在观众的身体和心理体验上，例如长长呼气、失重、喉咙发紧、眼眶湿润，补充更丰富也更具体；X 的一些感受直接描述左手、声线、颤音和琶音，偏向讲音乐本身。concise：X 虽然也有大字小字重复，例如有点想哭与眼泪不用憋着，但整体叙事有持续推进；Y 在 S05、S09、S13 等屏对小心、不安、能否长久有多处相近表达。human：X 的口语关系更自然，Y 的身处一段真实的亲密相处中、留意彼此的亲近是否依然自然、这份亲密会持续多久等说法有摘要腔或搭配不顺，并非因为碎块不完整而扣分。load：Y 每屏通常只有一两块大字，意群完整，停留时间也比较充足；X 经常一屏出现四至六处分散的高亮词，需要在多个位置之间寻找和串联。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d2da9294-d84c-4228-b3dc-4448b5c1c15c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T201731682885Z", "elapsed_seconds": 277.688, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T20:22:09.369203+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "3eeba4c2d0529f9dd38f23c692e668d0eff80609c6a777a5ec0c9303d1a3ca48", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_